    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Hazelcast AP Maps\n\nAP IMap view for Simulator workloads. These panels use Management Center `hz_map_*` metrics validated from the live `/metrics` scrape.\n\n**Key questions this dashboard answers:**\n- Which maps hold the most entries and memory?\n- What operation mix is the workload generating?\n- Are get/put/set/remove latencies rising during failover?\n- Are evictions, expirations, locked entries, or dirty entries appearing unexpectedly?\n\n**Filters:** **Cluster**, **Member**, and **Map**. Internal maps starting with `_` are excluded from most workload panels."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Map Inventory",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Live Maps",
      "description": "Distinct non-internal maps exported by MC.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count(count by (name) (hz_map_ownedEntryCount{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\", name!~\"^_.*\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "maps",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
